00:37:10,434 --> 00:37:16,434
Money Shot: The Pornhub Story is a 2023 Netflix documentary about
Pornhub and its parent company MindGeek (now Aylo).

10
00:41:18,260 --> 00:41:24,260
It presents interview footage from sex workers, ex-Pornhub
employees, journalists, and anti-sex-trafficking figures.

11
00:45:26,086 --> 00:45:32,086
The documentary focuses on a 2020 scandal over Pornhub hosting non-consensual pornography,
including of children, and how the aftermath affected pornographic performers.

12
00:49:33,913 --> 00:49:39,913
When Netflix approached Jigsaw Productions about the film, director Suzanne Hillinger wanted to highlight sex
workers' opinions because she believed that they had been underrepresented in media coverage.

13
00:53:41,739 --> 00:53:47,739
Hillinger said that many figures in the pornographic
industry were initially reluctant to participate.

14
00:57:49,565 --> 00:57:55,565
Cherie DeVille was skeptical but participated to present the narrative
that anti-sex-trafficking groups had right-wing agendas.

15
01:01:57,391 --> 01:02:03,391
Ex-Aylo employee Noelle Perdue worked as an archivist and
fact-checker, as well as being interviewed.

16
01:06:05,217 --> 01:06:11,217
According to Rotten Tomatoes, most reviews of the documentary were positive.

17
01:10:13,043 --> 01:10:19,043
However, reviewers were divided on many topics,
including the message, provenance, and pacing.

18
01:14:20,869 --> 01:14:26,869
Some critics called it neutral, but others saw it as pro-sex work.

19
01:18:28,695 --> 01:18:34,695
The focus on anti-sex-trafficking organizations' political aims was generally seen as a
strength, but some reviews criticized the interviews as lacking depth and a viewpoint.

20
01:22:36,521 --> 01:22:42,521
Other reviewers concluded that Pornhub's content moderation was lacking and that there
are issues with the concentration of money and power in the industry.

21
01:26:44,347 --> 01:26:50,347
The film explores themes of porn industry, porn
actress, adult filmmaking, onlyfans, porn.

22
01:30:52,173 --> 01:30:58,173
The tone is thought_provoking.
